{"id":"5930","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5930_main_altocumulus-volutus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这是高积云属中的新云种卷滚云的罕见实例。卷滚云通常称之为“卷轴云”，是一种长、水平、分裂的管状云块，通常好像是绕着水平轴缓慢滚动。它通常以单行出现，鲜有地平线至地平线的延伸。</p>\n<p>该实例在西端是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">平滑、典型的卷轴云</span>；中间是角塔式堡状云增长，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云底变得破碎</span>；东端是有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">共同云底</span>的角塔式堡状云增长。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">漏隙透光成层高积云</span>层位于东端的卷滚云上方，而在西端稍有重叠。与卷滚云在同一云底的一些<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">荚状高积云</span>在右侧低。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Michael Bruhn","location":"澳大利亚，布罗德梅多斯VIC 3047","latitude":"纬度: 37° 41' 24'' S","longitude":"经度: 144° 56' 50'' E","date":"02 August 2011 0819 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 8, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: P.4.6","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.4.6"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5930_syn_altocumulus-volutus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>随着速快移动但相当弱的冷锋向东抵近，气压梯度在收紧。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 澳大利亚联邦2011，澳大利亚气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5930_upper_altocumulus-volutus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>由于整夜辐射逆温以及从行星边界层顶部至719 hPa接近干绝热的直减率导致非常浅的行星边界层。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}